# Knowbase (ai-lab)

Личная платформа: аудио → STT → корпус → конспект → Q&A с цитатами.
**Нет** карты понятий и видео-пайплайна.

## Stack

- Backend: Java 17, Spring Boot 3.4, SQLite (`JdbcTemplate`), JWT, Spring AI / OpenRouter
- Frontend: Vite + vanilla JS (без React/TS)
- Ports: API `8081`, UI `5173`
- Secrets: только `application-local.yml` / env — **никогда** не коммитить ключи

## Architecture

Package-by-feature under `com.ailab.*`:
`auth`, `course`, `lecture`, `corpus`, `conspect`, `qa`, `stt`, `llm`, `db`, `common`, `stats`, `config`.

Layers: `*Controller` → `*Service` → `*Repository` (JdbcTemplate + nested `record` rows).
Ownership: always `CourseService.requireOwned(courseId)` before course-scoped work.
Errors: throw `IllegalArgumentException` / `IllegalStateException` / `SecurityException`; JSON `{ "error": "..." }` via `ApiExceptionHandler`.
API responses: `Map<String, Object>` / `List<Map<...>>` with camelCase keys (`createdAt`, not `created_at`).

## Agent workflow

- Local rules: `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` (this repo)
- Global Cursor user rules: high-level prefs only; **project rules win** on conflicts
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/add-course-endpoint/SKILL.md` for new course APIs
- Subagents: use explore for codebase search; shell for mvn/git; keep one-shot battle prompts atomic

## Do not

- Add concept-map / video features
- Put SQL in controllers or frontend
- Log secrets or full JWT tokens
- Introduce React/TypeScript without explicit request
